Loki: Log agrregation tool to store and query logs

We can collect logs from all of our applications running in a cluster / culsters and send it to LOKI
Loki stores thoses logs
If some Issue comes up ----> user can "query" loki [ex: time frame(start time - end time)] ---> loki reurns the logs for that time frame

Elastc Search Indexes full text from LOGs : Loki is a cost effiective alternative and Loki just indexes the Labels attached to the logs . 
"Labels" here are metadata tags that gets send with the logs.

Configuration and Query language of LOKI is similar to prometheus.



